<mj-text font-size="17px" font-weight="600" padding-bottom="8px"> Reset your password </mj-text>

<mj-text>
  Someone asked to reset the password for this account. If that was you, choose a new password using
  the button below.
</mj-text>

<mj-button
  href="{{resetUrl}}"
  background-color="#0b3d2e"
  color="#ffffff"
  border-radius="6px"
  padding="20px 0"
  font-size="15px"
>
  Choose a new password
</mj-button>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="13px">
  This link expires in {{ expiresInMinutes }} minutes and can be used once. If the button does not
  work, paste this into your browser:
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="12px">
  {{ resetUrl }}
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#7b8794" font-size="13px" padding-top="16px">
  If you did not ask for this, no action is needed — your password has not changed. Resetting it
  will also sign you out everywhere.
</mj-text>
